WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.103
DATE is appropriate when the calendar day matters
but the time of day does not

00:00:05.843 --> 00:00:11.375
Examples include birth date or a reporting date A
typed date can

00:00:11.388 --> 00:00:17.058
be sorted chronologically and used in date
arithmetic A text string that

00:00:17.085 --> 00:00:20.914
merely looks like a date does not provide the same
analytical guarantees
